      "name": "Small Hours",
      "maker": "NACHTFELD",
      "purpose": "A dark, vintage-coloured reverb voiced for cinematic future garage: lush slow-building pad washes, pitch-steady spaces for vocal chops and bells, tape-wobbled halls, dense plates for snares and claps, airy rooms, and gated or reverse swells.",
      "description": "A dark, vintage-coloured reverb voiced for cinematic future garage: lush slow-building pad washes, pitch-steady spaces for vocal chops and bells, tape-wobbled halls, dense plates for snares and claps, airy rooms, and gated or reverse swells. Shape the voicing, decay, size and swell, the era's darkness, the wobble's depth and speed and a little grit; low and high cut keep the tail clear of the sub and the hats.",
      "role": "fx",
      "tags": [
        "reverb",
        "dark",
        "ambient"
      ]
